DreamUserWidget {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget
    src   "A widget hierarchy that is a CLASS rather than an asset instance -- the counterpart to UMG's\nUUserWidget, and the thing a DreamUI prefab is becoming.\n\nIt is itself a UDreamWidget, exactly as UUserWidget is a UWidget. That is what makes nesting fall\nout for free: one of these placed inside another hierarchy is just a widget in that hierarchy,\nwhile its own contents come from its own class.\n\nIts contents live behind WidgetTree rather than directly in Children, and that indirection is not\ndecoration. Without it \"the class of one widget\" and \"the class of a hierarchy\" would be the same\nthing, and a UDreamWidget subclass (they are Blueprintable) could not be told apart from a\nhierarchy template. UMG buys the same separation with UWidgetTree, and it is not optional here\neither.\n\nWidgetTree is Transient: a class template must never carry an expanded subtree, or a nested user\nwidget would be baked into its parent's template and stop tracking its own class. It is built at\nInitialize, from the class, every time."
    text  "一种作为类而非资源实例的控件层级——对应 UMG 的\nUUserWidget，也是 DreamUI 预制体正在演变成的东西。\n\n它本身就是一个 UDreamWidget，正如 UUserWidget 就是一个 UWidget。正因如此，嵌套才能自然\n成立：把它放进另一个层级里，它只是该层级中的一个控件，\n而它自己的内容来自它自己的类。\n\n它的内容位于 WidgetTree 之后，而不是直接放在 Children 里，这层间接并非\n装饰。没有它，“单个控件的类”和“一个层级的类”就会是同一\n回事，UDreamWidget 的子类（它们可蓝图化）也就无法与\n层级模板区分开。UMG 用 UWidgetTree 换来同样的分离，这里也并非\n可有可无。\n\nWidgetTree 是 Transient 的：类模板绝不能携带已展开的子树，否则嵌套的用户\n控件会被烘焙进父模板，不再跟踪自己的类。它在\nInitialize 时每次都从类构建。"
    state machine
}

DreamUserWidget:AddToPlayerScreen {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:AddToPlayerScreen
    src   "UMG's AddToPlayerScreen: AddToViewport on the owning player's screen, refused when there is no\nowning player rather than falling back to screen 0. That is the whole difference here, since\nevery screen already is one player's. True when the widget is on that screen afterwards."
    text  "UMG 的 AddToPlayerScreen：在所属玩家的视口上调用 AddToViewport，当没有\n所属玩家时直接拒绝，而不是回退到屏幕 0。这里的全部差别就在于此，因为\n每个屏幕本来就属于一个玩家。之后控件位于该屏幕上时返回 true。"
    state machine
}

DreamUserWidget:AddToViewport {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:AddToViewport
    src   "UMG's AddToViewport: put this widget on screen at ZOrder and switch it on. The other half is\nUDreamWidget::RemoveFromParent, which takes it off again and keeps it.\n\nThere is one screen per local player and no shared layer behind them, so the screen is the\nowning player's -- the first local player's when nothing named one, which is the whole answer in\na single-player game. Calling it on a widget already on screen moves it to ZOrder and shows it\nagain. ZOrder is the page canvas's sort order, and 1000 and up belong to the page stack (see\nUDreamScreenUISubsystem::AddToViewport).\n\nRefused, as UMG refuses it, for a widget that already has a parent other than the screen: it\nwould be taken out of that hierarchy without the hierarchy being told. RemoveFromParent first."
    text  "UMG 的 AddToViewport：按 ZOrder 把这个控件放到视口上并启用它。另一半是\nUDreamWidget::RemoveFromParent，它把控件再次取下并保留它。\n\n每个本地玩家各有一个屏幕，它们背后没有共享层，因此屏幕就是\n所属玩家的——没有指定时就是第一个本地玩家的，这在单人游戏中就是\n全部答案。对已经在屏幕上的控件调用它，会把它移动到 ZOrder 并再次\n显示。ZOrder 是页面画布的排序顺序，1000 及以上属于页面栈（见\nUDreamScreenUISubsystem::AddToViewport）。\n\n对于已经拥有屏幕以外父级的控件会被拒绝，UMG 也是如此：否则它\n会被从该层级中取出，而该层级并不知情。请先调用 RemoveFromParent。"
    state machine
}

