    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:bAllowEventBubbleUp
    src   "The bubble policy every pointer/drag Native* returns by default. True, unlike UISelectable's\nfalse: a user widget is a container, and a container that silently swallowed every click inside\nit would break each screen it was placed on. Set false to consume events at this boundary."
    text  "所有指针/拖拽 Native* 默认返回的冒泡策略。为 true，而 UISelectable 为\nfalse：用户控件是容器，若容器静默吞掉其中的每一次点击，\n就会破坏它所在的每个屏幕。设为 false 可在此边界处消费事件。"
    state machine
}

