DreamUserWidget:EachAdapters {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:EachAdapters
    src   "One per `each` and per `for` block, kept alive here. An `each` adapter is the list views', which the\ncore does not name -- the registered IDreamUIEachBindingHandler makes and refreshes those, and the view\nholds them only as its data source interface -- so the array is typed as UObject; a `for` adapter is a\nUDreamUIForAdapter, the core's own, and is told apart by a cast."
    text  "每个 `each` 块和每个 `for` 块各一个，在此保持存活。`each` 适配器是列表视图的，核心\n并不指名它——已注册的 IDreamUIEachBindingHandler 负责创建并刷新这些绑定，而视图\n仅以数据源接口的形式持有它们——因此该数组被类型化为 UObject；`for` 适配器是\nUDreamUIForAdapter，属于核心自身，通过一次类型转换加以区分。"
    state machine
}

DreamUserWidget:EvaluatePropertyBindings {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:EvaluatePropertyBindings
    src   "Run ALL of this widget's property bindings once: call each bound function, hand the result to\nthe widget's setter. Runs at Initialize (so the first frame shows bound values), and is safe\nto call by hand.\n\nGoing through the setter is what makes the change take -- see FDreamWidgetPropertyBinding."
    text  "把此控件的所有属性绑定各执行一次：调用每个被绑定的函数，把结果交给\n控件的 setter。在 Initialize 时运行（因此第一帧就能显示绑定值），也可以安全地\n手动调用。\n\n经由 setter 才能使更改生效——见 FDreamWidgetPropertyBinding。"
    state machine
}

