DreamUserWidget:FindSlotWidget {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:FindSlotWidget
    src   "The widget carrying the UDreamNamedSlot of that name inside this instance, or null.\n\nTwo roads, because there are two kinds of contents. A class built from an archetype has a\nUDreamWidgetTree to walk. A native control has none -- nothing instanced a template to make\nits contents; it built them under itself in NativeOnInitialized -- so the walk is its own\nchildren, stopping at any nested instance, whose slots belong to that instance."
    text  "在此实例内承载该名称的 UDreamNamedSlot 的控件，或 null。\n\n两条路径，因为内容有两种。由原型构建的类有\nUDreamWidgetTree 可以遍历。原生控件则没有——没有任何模板被实例化来生成\n它的内容；它在 NativeOnInitialized 中在自己的下面构建了这些内容——所以遍历的是它自己的\n子级，遇到任何嵌套实例就停止，因为那些插槽属于该实例。"
    state machine
}

