DreamUserWidget:GetAnimationByName {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:GetAnimationByName
    src   "The animation of this widget's hierarchy with that display name, or null. The counterpart of\nPlayAnimationByName for callers that want the animation OBJECT -- to bind an event to it, to\nask whether it is playing, to hand it to a handle-taking call -- rather than to play it. Names\nan embedded animation by its display name and a standalone sequence asset by its asset name,\nexactly as PlayAnimationByName does."
    text  "此控件层级中具有该显示名称的动画，没有则为 null。它相当于\nPlayAnimationByName，供想要拿到动画对象本身——而非播放它——的调用方使用：为其绑定事件、\n查询它是否正在播放、把它传给接受句柄的调用。与 PlayAnimationByName 完全一致，\n内嵌动画按显示名称指定，\n独立序列资源按资源名称指定。"
    state machine
}

