DreamUserWidget:GetDefaultSlotName {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:GetDefaultSlotName
    src   "The slot that content arriving WITHOUT a slot name goes to -- .dui nesting, and a designer\ndrop onto the control itself. None means unslotted content stays where it landed.\n\nNesting is the one thing .dui does natively, so for the common case -- one hole, the obvious\none -- it should not have to be spelled. `Native.Button OK { Image Icon {} Text {} }` puts\nboth children inside the button because the button's default slot is its content area."
    text  "未指定插槽名称的内容所进入的插槽——包括 .dui 嵌套，以及设计器\n直接拖放到控件本身上的内容。为 None 时，未指定插槽的内容留在其落下的位置。\n\n嵌套是 .dui 原生就能做到的事，因此对于常见情形——一个孔，显而易见的那一个——\n不应非要显式写出。`Native.Button OK { Image Icon {} Text {} }` 会把两个子项都\n放进按钮内部，因为按钮的默认插槽就是它的内容区域。"
    state machine
}

DreamUserWidget:GetLocalSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:GetLocalSize
    src   "This widget's own box, in its own space -- the local half of UMG's GetCachedGeometry.\n\nThere is no FGeometry here and there should not be: this framework composes meshes rather than\npainting Slate, so \"paint space\" and \"tick space\" are the same space and the honest answer is a\nsize and a screen rectangle rather than a transform nobody can use."
    text  "此控件自身的盒子，位于其自身空间中——即 UMG 的 GetCachedGeometry 的局部部分。\n\n这里没有 FGeometry，也不应该有：此框架合成网格，而不是绘制 Slate，\n因此“绘制空间”与“tick 空间”是同一个空间，如实的答案是一个尺寸和一个屏幕矩形，\n而不是一个没人能用的变换。"
    state machine
}

DreamUserWidget:GetNativeSlotNames {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:GetNativeSlotNames
    src   "The holes this CLASS opens, for a class whose contents are code rather than an archetype.\n\nAn archetype-built class declares its slots by putting a UDreamNamedSlot in its tree, and\nevery consumer -- the compiler, the designer's hierarchy rows, the text builder -- reads them\noff that tree. A native control has no tree to read: it has none on the CDO, and none at all\nuntil it builds one. So the class itself has to be able to answer, before any instance exists.\n\nThe names returned here are a promise: each must be the display name of a widget the control\nputs a UDreamNamedSlot on. This is the declaration and the built tree is the implementation;\nFindSlotWidget is what matches them, by name."
    text  "此类打开的孔，适用于内容由代码而非原型构建的类。\n\n由原型构建的类把 UDreamNamedSlot 放进自己的树来声明插槽，每个使用方——\n编译器、设计器的层级行、文本构建器——都从该树中读取。原生控件没有可读取的树：\nCDO 上没有，在它构建出自己的树之前也完全没有。因此，类本身必须能在任何\n实例存在之前给出答案。\n\n此处返回的名称是一个承诺：每个都必须是控件放置了 UDreamNamedSlot 的控件的\n显示名称。这里是声明，构建出的树是实现；\nFindSlotWidget 负责按名称将它们匹配起来。"
    state machine
}

