DreamUserWidget:GetWidgetFromName {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:GetWidgetFromName
    src   "The widget of that variable name inside this instance -- UMG's GetWidgetFromName.\n\nThe class model's answer to \"reach a widget by name from a graph\". The generated class is a\nUClass and has no useful Blueprint form of its own, so the information it holds is reached\nthrough the instance, which is the only place a graph ever has one -- exactly how UMG does it."
    text  "此实例内具有该变量名的控件——即 UMG 的 GetWidgetFromName。\n\n这是类模型对“从图表中按名称访问控件”的答案。生成的类是一个 UClass，\n自身没有可用的蓝图形式，因此它持有的信息要通过实例来获取，\n而实例是图表唯一能拿到它的地方——UMG 正是这么做的。"
    state machine
}

