DreamUserWidget:IsDesignTime {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:IsDesignTime
    src   "True in the designer's preview, false in PIE and in a cooked game -- UMG's IsDesignTime.\n\nOnInitialized runs in the preview as well as at runtime, by design, and until now a graph had\nno way to tell the two apart: the rule was a C++ inline with no reflected face, so \"do not do\nthis while the designer is showing me\" was unwriteable in Blueprint."
    text  "在设计器预览中为 true，在 PIE 和烘焙后的游戏中为 false——即 UMG 的 IsDesignTime。\n\n按设计，OnInitialized 在预览和运行时都会运行，而在此之前，图表\n无法区分两者：该规则是一个没有反射接口的 C++ 内联，所以“不要在设计器\n显示时执行此操作”在蓝图中根本写不出来。"
    state machine
}

DreamUserWidget:K2_BroadcastFieldValueChanged {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:K2_BroadcastFieldValueChanged
    src   "Tell everyone listening that a field changed -- UMG's K2_BroadcastFieldValueChanged.\n\nUntil now the add and the remove were reflected and the BROADCAST was not, so a Blueprint could\nsubscribe to a field and then had no way to say the field had moved: a graph-side property\ncould be listened to and never announced. The C++ side has always had this; this is the same\ncall with a name resolved from a FieldNotificationId.\n\nBlueprintInternalUseOnly, as UMG marks it, because the useful node is the one the field-notify\nproperty generates rather than this raw by-name call."
    text  "通知所有监听者某个字段已更改——即 UMG 的 K2_BroadcastFieldValueChanged。\n\n在此之前，添加和移除都有反射，而广播没有，因此蓝图可以\n订阅某个字段，却无法表明该字段已变化：图表侧的属性\n可以被监听，却永远无法发出通知。C++ 侧一直具备此能力；这里是\n用从 FieldNotificationId 解析出的名称进行的同一调用。\n\n如同 UMG 的标记，BlueprintInternalUseOnly——因为有用的节点是由字段通知\n属性生成的那个，而不是这个按名称的原始调用。"
    state machine
}

DreamUserWidget:K2_GetDeclaredSlotNames {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:K2_GetDeclaredSlotNames
    src   "The named slots this instance declares, in the order its class declares them."
    text  "此实例声明的具名插槽，按其类声明它们的顺序排列。"
    state machine
}

DreamUserWidget:ListenForInputAction {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:ListenForInputAction
    src   "UMG's ListenForInputAction, on this framework's own action layer.\n\nThe binding lives as long as this widget does -- it is unregistered on destruct -- and is scoped\nto the navigation scope this widget is inside, so it only fires while that screen is the one in\nfront. That is the difference from UMG, and it is the point: UMG binds to the player's input\ncomponent and leaves \"is my screen even open\" to the caller.\n\n@param InAction  A row of the project's input action table; see FDreamUIInputActionData.\n@param bDisplayInActionBar  And-ed with the row's own flag; a caller can hide but not reveal."
    text  "UMG 的 ListenForInputAction，位于此框架自己的操作层上。\n\n该绑定与此控件同寿——在析构时注销——且作用域限定为\n此控件所在的导航作用域，因此只有该界面在最前面时才会触发。\n这就是与 UMG 的区别，也正是要点所在：UMG 绑定到玩家的输入\n组件，而把“我的界面是否已打开”留给调用方。\n\n@param InAction  项目输入操作表中的一行；参见 FDreamUIInputActionData。\n@param bDisplayInActionBar  与该行自身的标志相与；调用方可以隐藏，但不能显示。"
    state machine
}

DreamUserWidget:NamedSlotContent {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:NamedSlotContent
    src   "What the HOST authored for the slots this widget's class declares, keyed by slot name.\n\nThe values are widgets of the host's tree, not of this class's -- that is the whole point.\nNothing about them is a difference recorded against another asset: they are the host's own\nwidgets, authored in the host's hierarchy, that happen to be placed through a hole the class\nopened. Instanced, so object instancing carries them across with the rest of the host's tree,\nand Initialize hangs them under the matching UDreamNamedSlot afterwards.\n\nEmpty on the class template of a class that declares slots -- a slot with nothing in it is the\nnormal state, and the class has no business filling its own holes."
    text  "宿主为此控件类声明的插槽所创作的内容，以插槽名称为键。\n\n这些值是宿主树中的控件，而不是本类树的——这正是关键所在。\n它们完全不是相对其他资产记录的差异：它们是宿主自己的\n控件，创作于宿主的层级结构中，只是恰好通过该类\n开出的孔洞放置。由于是实例化的，对象实例化会随宿主树的其余部分一并携带它们，\n随后 Initialize 会将它们挂到匹配的 UDreamNamedSlot 下。\n\n在声明插槽的类的类模板上为空——插槽里什么都没有是\n正常状态，类也没有理由去填自己的孔洞。"
    state machine
}

