DreamUserWidget:OnSlotContentAttached {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:OnSlotContentAttached
    src   "The Blueprint half of NativeOnSlotContentAttached: the host's content is in place.\n\nThis hook existed and was reachable only from C++, so the whole point of it -- \"react to what my\nhost put in my slots\" -- was closed to the Blueprint authors it was written for."
    text  "NativeOnSlotContentAttached 的蓝图部分：宿主的内容已就位。\n\n此钩子原本存在，却只能从 C++ 访问，因此它的全部意义——“对我的\n宿主放入我的插槽的内容做出反应”——对它所面向的蓝图作者是封闭的。"
    state machine
}

