DreamUserWidget:PreConstruct {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:PreConstruct
    src   "UMG's PreConstruct, with the flag it is named for.\n\nRuns at the top of Initialize, in the designer preview and at runtime alike, before the contents\nexist -- which is exactly what it is for: setting the properties the contents will be built\nfrom. On Initialized is the moment AFTER, when the tree is there to read."
    text  "UMG 的 PreConstruct，并带有其名称所指的标志。\n\n在 Initialize 开头运行，设计器预览与运行时都一样，此时内容尚\n不存在——这正是它的用途：设置构建内容将要用到的属性。\nOn Initialized 是其后的时刻，此时树已可供读取。"
    state machine
}

