DreamUserWidget:SetPositionInViewport {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:SetPositionInViewport
    src   "UMG's SetPositionInViewport, and the three that go with it.\n\nA page is laid out full-bleed by default -- anchors 0..1, no inset -- and the stack re-applies\nthat on every refresh, so a widget positioned by hand was moved back the next time anything was\npushed. Calling any of these four marks the page as HAND-PLACED, and the stack then leaves its\ngeometry alone while still owning its sort order and its shown/hidden state. That is the only\nway \"a floating window that is not full screen\" can exist on the page stack at all.\n\nPositions are in the screen canvas's space, which is the space the screen root is sized in."
    text  "UMG 的 SetPositionInViewport（设置视口位置），以及与之配套的另外三个函数。\n\n页面默认按全幅布局——锚点 0..1，无边距——并且堆栈会在每次刷新时\n重新应用该布局，因此手动定位的控件会在下次压入任何内容时被移回原位。\n调用这四个函数中的任意一个都会将页面标记为手动放置，此后堆栈便\n不再改动其几何形状，同时仍负责其排序顺序及其显示/隐藏状态。这是\n“非全屏的浮动窗口”能够存在于页面堆栈上的唯一方式。\n\n位置使用屏幕画布的空间，即屏幕根节点采用尺寸的空间。"
    state machine
}

DreamUserWidget:SetViewModel {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUserWidget.h#DreamUserWidget:SetViewModel
    src   "Hand this widget the object its `viewmodels` entry Name holds -- what a host does from code that cannot see the\nBlueprint class's variables (C++, UnrealSharp). The object must be of the entry's class; it is written into the\nentry's variable and the field is broadcast, so every binding reading through it re-reads. Null clears the entry.\nFalse, with a warning in the log, when this class has no such entry or the object is of another class.\n\nCalled before the widget initializes, the object is what On Initialized and every binding's first value see, and\na `= new` / `= global` / `= parent` entry is then left as it was given."
    text  "将此控件 `viewmodels` 条目 Name 所持有的对象交给它——即宿主在看不到\n蓝图类变量的代码（C++、UnrealSharp）中所做的操作。该对象必须是该条目的类；它会被写入该条目\n的变量并广播字段，因此所有通过它读取的绑定都会重新读取。传入 Null 会清除该条目。\n当此类没有该条目或对象属于其他类时返回 false，并在日志中记录警告。\n\n在控件初始化之前调用时，该对象就是 On Initialized 以及所有绑定首个值所看到的内容，\n而 `= new` / `= global` / `= parent` 条目则保持被赋予时的状态。"
    state machine
}

